+Correct unit40 lower-language adapter bindings after actual Actions failure: use existing appFSM.query instead of the Source/PlusCal symbolic dispatchProjectQuery name, and use dispatchProjectCommand's real direct result instead of destructuring the logical pseudocode tuple. Code91/actual canonical Git-blob digest, review042 failure evidence and this patch pair change atomically. All regression assertions retained.
+
+## Rationale and alternatives
+
+Actual JS adapter inspection proves the direct return/query binding. Reuse it; reject inventing an adapter alias or changing the adapter return type across the application. Source45/pseudocode23 already specify the correct semantic operation, so do not change them to justify a lower translation typo. Previously missed physical adapter mapping is recorded rather than mislabeling static gates as behavioral verification.
+
+## Scope and verification
+
+Code90 regression39150693529 and repeat39150723812 failed, although build/canonical/cumulative/fidelity passed as recorded in review042. New code91 regression111+111/repeat/build/cumulative/fidelity pending. No test/runtime/checker execution locally; Git diff and blob fingerprint calculation only. No policy/Source/PlusCal/model/dist/selection semantics changes; code remains stale and whole goal open. The nonexistent development-layer-versions.yml dispatch returned404 and ran nothing; the actual inspected workflow is development-layer-version.yml, used successfully afterward. Initial local commit lacked author config; retried with the existing authenticated repository identity using per-command options, no global config changes.
